  "title": "Debbie's Ultimate Mushroom Dish",
  "description": "Who would've thunk that so few ingredients would make the best, and I mean BEST, mushrooms that you've ever tasted? I always serve this at Christmas. Use any combination of mushrooms you like, but make sure to use fresh and not canned.",
  "authors": [
